WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.707
A decoder block receives hidden states and produces updated hidden states.

00:00:04.707 --> 00:00:12.417
Normalization prepares the representation, masked self-attention mixes information across allowed token positions,

00:00:12.417 --> 00:00:17.192
and a residual connection preserves a direct path around that transformation.

00:00:17.192 --> 00:00:24.680
A second normalization is followed by the feed-forward network, or F F N, and another residual connection.

00:00:25.294 --> 00:00:30.456
Both attention and the feed-forward network contain learned weight matrices.

00:00:30.456 --> 00:00:36.183
The output hidden states from this block become the input hidden states for the next block.
